hadiths[25]{hadithnumber,text}:
"252","[AI-translation] Hum se Ali bin Hujar ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Isa bin Yunus ne rivayat ki, Hisham bin Urwah se, unke bhai Abdullah bin Urwah se, Urwah se, Aishah se. Unhon ne kaha: Gyarah auratein baithi hain, unhone ek dusre se aahad wa paqd kiya ke apne shohar ki khabar mein se kuch nahi chupayengi. Pehli ne kaha: Mera shohar oont ka patla Gosht hai jo ek khatarnaak pahaar ke choti par hai, na to aasan hai ke wahan tak pohancha jaye, aur na mota hai ke kahi aur muntaqil kiya jaye. Doosri ne kaha: Mera shohar, main uski khabar zahir nahi karti, mujhe darr hai ke kahin wo chhoot na jaye, agar main uska zikr karoon to uske andar ki kharabi aur pechish ka zikr karoon. Teesri ne kaha: Mera shohar lamba hai, agar main boloon to tallaq di jaaon, aur agar chup rahoon to latak kar rakh di jaaon. Chothi ne kaha: Mera shohar Tihamah ki raat ke jaisa hai, na garmi hai, na sardi, na khauf, na uktaahat. Panchvi ne kaha: Mera shohar jab ghar mein dakhil hota hai to aaram karta hai, aur jab nikalta hai to shair ban jata hai, aur jo kuch usne hukm diya hota hai uske baare mein nahi poochta. Chathi ne kaha: Mera shohar jab khata hai to nigal jata hai, jab peeta hai to poori pyali ka peeta hai, jab leta hai to lado let ho jata hai, aur haath nahi dhaalat taake maloom kar sake ke kya taklif hai. Satvi ne kaha: Mera shohar sust mohtaj hai, ya aalood dimagh hai, har beemari us mein hai, ya to sar phaar de, ya nali phaar de, ya sub kuch jama kar le. Athvi ne kaha: Mera shohar choohar ki tarah najuk hai, aur uski khusboo khalanjan (zarneb) jaisi hai. Nasvi ne kaha: Mera shohar buland qad, azeem-ush-shan, barae-ramaad (zyada raakh wala), ghar se majlis ke qareeb hai. Dasvi ne kaha: Mera shohar maalik hai, kya bataon maalik kya hai, maalik is se behtar hai, uske bahut se oont hain, jo barkat wale hain, charane ke jagah kam hain, jab dhol ki awaz sunte hain to yaqeen kar lete hain ke hum halaak ho gaye. Gyarahvi ne kaha: Mera shohar Abu Zar'a hai, kya bataon Abu Zar'a kya hai? Usne mere kaanon ko zevar se aabaad kiya, mere baazu ko charbi se bhar diya, mujhe khushi di, meri nafs mujhe pasandid ho gayi, mujhe ek choti si bakri wale ghar mein paya, mujhe ghodey, aawaz karne wale oont, gaahak oont aur khaad wale ghar mein rakh diya, uske yahan main bolti hoon to mujhe bura nahi kahaa jaata, soti hoon to subah tak soti hoon, aur peeti hoon to pyali bhar pi kar aaraam se baith jati hoon. Abu Zar'a ki maa, kya bataon Abu Zar'a ki maa kya hai, uske bhare bhare bartan, aur uska khula ghar. Abu Zar'a ka beta, kya bataon Abu Zar'a ka beta kya hai, uski neend patti ke naram hisse jaisi, aur usko bakri ke bachhe ki tang khila kar pet bhar diya jata hai. Abu Zar'a ki beti, kya bataon Abu Zar'a ki beti kya hai, apne abbu ki itaat karne wali aur ammi ki itaat karne wali, kapde se bhari, padosan ki jalan. Abu Zar'a ki kaneez, kya bataon Abu Zar'a ki kaneez kya hai, hamari baat phailati nahi, hamare rabbad ki tafseel nahi karti, hamare ghar ko masiyat se nahi bhar deti. Unhon ne kaha: Abu Zar'a nikla jab ke oontaniyon ka dahi bil raha tha, ek aurat se mila jis ke do bachay the, do cheeton ke jaise, uske kamar ke neeche do anaar se khail rahe the, usne mujhe tallaq diya aur us se shadi ki, maine uske baad ek shareef mard se shadi ki, jo ek khoobsoorat ghare sawar hua, ek khaas talwaar pakri, aur mujhe bahut se mal ek jagah jama karke laa diya, aur mujhe har khushboo wali cheez do-do di, aur kaha: Aiyye kha lo Umm-e-Zar'a, aur apne ghar walon ko aab-paraish karo, agar main sab kuch jama karoon jo mujhe diya hai, to bhi Abu Zar'a ke chote bartan ke barabar nahi hoga. Aishah ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Main tumhare liye Abu Zar'a ki tarah hoon Umm-e-Zar'a ke liye."
"253","[AI-translation] Hum se Muhammad bin Muthanna ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Abdur Rehman bin Mahdi ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Israel ne rivayat ki, Abu Ishaq se, Abdullah bin Yazed se, Bara bin Azib se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab bhi sone ki jagah lete to apna daahina haath apne daahine gaal ke neeche rakhte, aur farmate: Aye Rab! Mujhe apne azaab se bacha le us din jab tu apne bandon ko uthayega. Hum se Muhammad bin Muthanna ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Abdur Rehman ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Israel ne rivayat ki, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Ubaidah se, Abdullah se, isi jaisa (rivayat) aur unhone kaha: Us din jab tu apne bandon ko jama karega."
"254","[AI-translation] Hum se Muhammad bin Muthanna ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Abdur Rehman bin Mahdi ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Israel ne rivayat ki, Abu Ishaq se, Abdullah bin Yazed se, Bara bin Azib se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab bhi sone ki jagah lete to apna daahina haath apne daahine gaal ke neeche rakhte, aur farmate: Aye Rab! Mujhe apne azaab se bacha le us din jab tu apne bandon ko uthayega. Hum se Muhammad bin Muthanna ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Abdur Rehman ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Israel ne rivayat ki, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Ubaidah se, Abdullah se, isi jaisa (rivayat) aur unhone kaha: Us din jab tu apne bandon ko jama karega."
"255","[AI-translation] Hum se Mahmood bin Ghailan ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Abdur Razzaq ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Sufyan ne rivayat ki, Abdul Malik bin Umair se, Ribee bin Hirash se, Huzaifah se, unhone kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab bhi apne bistar par aate to farmate: Aye Allah! Tere naam se marta hoon aur jeeta hoon. Aur jab uthte to farmate: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jisne hamein maut ke baad zinda kiya, aur usi ki taraf laut kar jana hai."
"256","[AI-translation] Hum se Qutaibah bin Saeed ne rivayat ki, kaha: Hum se Mufazzal bin Fazzalah ne rivayat ki, Uqail se, mujhe lagta hai Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se. Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab bhi har raat apne bistar par aate to apne dono haath ko jama karte aur un mein phoonkte, aur un mein padhte: Qul huwallahu ahad, Qul a'uzu birabbil falaq aur Qul a'uzu birabbin naas. Phir un dono se apne jism ka jitna hissa ho sakay phair dete, un se apne sar aur chehre se aate hue jism se phairte, yeh kaam teen martaba karte."
"257","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashshar, qala: haddasana Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi, qala: haddasana Sufyan, an Salama bin Kuhail, an Kuraib, an Ibn Abbas: ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) so gaye yahan tak ke phoonk maari, aur jab aap sote to phoonkte the, to Bilal aaye aur unhein namaz ki khabar de di, to aap uthe aur namaz padhi, aur wuzu na kiya, aur is hadith mein qissa hai."
"258","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Mansur, qala: haddasana 'Affan, qala: haddasana Hammad bin Salama, an Thabit, an Anas bin Malik: ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab apne bistar par aate to farmate: Alhamdulillah jisne hamein khilaya aur pilaya, hamein kaafi rakha aur panah di, to kitne log hain jinhein na koi kaafi hai aur na koi panah dene wala."
"259","[AI-translation] Haddasana Al-Husain bin Muhammad Al-Jurairi, qala: haddasana Sulaiman bin Harb, qala: haddasana Hammad bin Salama, an Humaid, an Bakr bin Abdullah Al-Mazani, an Abdullah bin Rabah, an Abu Qatada: ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab raat mein manzil karte to apne daahine pahlu par lete, aur jab subah-e-sadiq ke qareeb manzil karte to apna bazoo khada karte aur apna sar apni hatheli par rakh lete."
"260","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaiba bin Saeed wa Bishr bin Mu'adh, qala: Haddasana Abu Awanah, 'an Ziyad bin Ilaqah, 'an Al-Mughira bin Shu'bah, qal: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne itni namaz padhi ke un ke qadmein phool gaye. To un se kaha gaya: Kya aap is takalluf ko uthate hain, halan ke Allah ne aap ka pichla aur aane wala gunah maaf kar diya hai? Farmaya: Kya main shukar guzaar banda na banoon?"
"261","[AI-translation] Ham se riwayat ki Abu Ammar Al-Hussain bin Huraith ne, farmaya: Ham se riwayat ki Fazl bin Musa ne, Muhammad bin Amr se, wo Abi Salamah se, aur wo Abi Hurairah se, farmaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz padhte the yahan tak ke un ke pao sooj jate. Unhon ne farmaya: Un se kaha gaya: Kya aap yeh karte hain halaanke aap ko yeh baat pohanch chuki hai ke Allah Ta'ala ne aap ke pichle aur aagale gunah maaf kar diye hain? Unhon ne farmaya: Kya main ek shukar guzaar banda na banoon?"
"262","[AI-translation] Ham say 'Isa bin 'Uthman bin 'Isa bin 'Abd-ur-Rahman ar-Ramli ne haddith kiya, farmaye: Hamay mere chacha Yahya bin 'Isa ar-Ramli ne haddith kiya, Al-A'mash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah se, kehne lagay: Rasulullah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) qiyam farmate aur namaz padhte yahan tak ke unke qadmein suaj jati thin. To unse kaha jata: Aye Rasulallah! Aap aisa karte hain halaanke Allah ne aapke guzashta aur aindah gunah maaf kar diye hain? Aapne farmaya: Kya main shukar guzar banda na banoon?"
"263","[AI-translation] Ham say Muhammad bin Bashshar ne haddith kiya, farmaye: Hamay Muhammad bin Ja'far ne haddith kiya, farmaye: Hamay Shu'ba ne haddith kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Aswad bin Yazed se, kehne lagay: Maine 'Aishah se Rasulullah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ki raat ki namaz ke bare mein poocha? To unhon ne farmaya: Aap raat ke ibteda mein sote the phir uthte. Jab seher ka waqt hota to witr ada farmate, phir apne bistar par atay. Agar unki koi zaroorat hoti to apne ahal ke pas jate. Jab azan sunte to uth khade hote. Agar janabat ki halat mein hote to un par pani bahate, warna wuzu karte aur namaz ke liye nikal jate."
"264","[AI-translation] Ham say Qutayba bin Sa'id ne haddith kiya, Malik bin Anas se (h) aur hamay Ishaq bin Musa al-Ansari ne haddith kiya, farmaye: Hamay Ma'n ne haddith kiya, Malik se, Makhrama bin Sulayman se, Kurayb se, Ibn 'Abbas se, ki unhon ne unhein bataya ke unhone Maymunah ke yahan raat guzari halaanke woh unki khala thin, farmaye: To mein takiye ke arz mein let gaya aur Rasulullah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) uski taul mein let gaye. Rasulullah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) so gaye yahan tak ke jab raat aadhi guzarne lagi ya is se thodi pehle ya thodi baad, to Rasulullah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) bedar hue, to apne chehre se neend mitane lage, phir Surah Aal-e-Imran ki aakhir ki das ayat padhi, phir ek latak hue shan ki taraf qiyam farmaya aur us se wuzu kiya, to khoobsurat wuzu kiya, phir namaz padhne ke liye khade hue. Abdullah bin Abbas ne kaha: To mein unke pas khada ho gaya to Rasulullah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne apna dayan hath mere sar par rakh phir mere dayan kan ko pakar liya aur use mod diya. Phir do rakaat, phir do rakaat, phir do rakaat, phir do rakaat, phir do rakaat, phir do rakaat padhi. Ma'n ne kaha: Chh martaba, phir witr ada kiya, phir let gaye yahan tak ke mu'azzhin unke pas aaya, to uth khade hue aur do halki rakaaten padhi, phir nikle aur fajr ki namaz padhi."
"265","[AI-translation] Ham say Abu Kurayb Muhammad bin al-'Ala' ne haddith kiya, farmaye: Hamay Waki' ne haddith kiya, Shu'ba se, Abu Jamra se, Ibn 'Abbas se, kehne lagay: Nabi (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) raat mein thera rakaat namaz padhte the."
"266","[AI-translation] Ham say Qutayba bin Sa'id ne haddith kiya, farmaye: Hamay Abu 'Awana ne haddith kiya, Qatada se, Zurara bin Awfa se, Sa'd bin Hisham se, 'Aishah se: Ke Nabi (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) agar raat mein namaz na padhte, to neend unhein is se roke deti, ya unki aankh ghaleb aa jati, to din mein barah rakaat padhte the."
"267","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Al-'Ala, qala: haddasana Abu Usama, 'an Hisham ya'ni Ibn Hassan, 'an Muhammad bin Sirin, 'an Abu Huraira, 'an Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam, farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi raat ko khada ho to apni namaz do halki rak'aton se shuru kare."
"268","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaiba bin Sa'id, 'an Malik bin Anas (h) wa haddasana Ishaq bin Musa, qala: haddasana Ma'n, qala: haddasana Malik, 'an Abdullah bin Abi Bakr, 'an abihi, ke Abdullah bin Qais bin Makhrama ne unhein khabar di, 'an Zaid bin Khalid Al-Juhani, ke unhone kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki namaz ko zaroor dekhunga, to maine unke atabe ko, ya unke fustat ko takiya banaya, phir Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne do halki rak'atein padhi, phir do lambi rak'atein padhi, lambi, lambi, phir do rak'atein padhi jo un se pehli wali se kamtar thin, phir do rak'atein padhi jo un se pehli wali se kamtar thin, phir do rak'atein padhi jo un se pehli wali se kamtar thin, phir do rak'atein padhi jo un se pehli wali se kamtar thin, phir witr padha, to yeh terah rak'atein hui."
"269","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Musa, qala: haddasana Ma'n, qala: haddasana Malik, 'an Sa'id bin Abi Sa'id Al-Maqburi, 'an Abi Salama bin Abd-ur-Rahman, ke unhone unhein khabar di ke unhone Aisha se pucha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki Ramazan mein namaz kaisi hoti thi? To unhone farmaya: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Ramazan mein ya uske siwa gyarah rak'aton se zyada namaz nahi padhte the, char rak'atein padhte, unke khoobsurti aur lambai se mat pucho, phir char rak'atein padhte, unke khoobsurti aur lambai se mat pucho, phir teen rak'atein padhte. Aisha ne kaha: Maine kaha: Ya Rasulallah! Kya aap witr se pehle sote hain? To aapne farmaya: Aye Aisha! Mere aankhein soti hain, aur mera dil nahi sota."
"270","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Musa, qala: haddasana Ma'n, qala: haddasana Malik, 'an Ibn Shihab, 'an Urwa, 'an Aisha: Ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam raat mein gyarah rak'atein padhte, jin mein se ek rak'at witr karte, phir jab us se farigh ho jate to apne dayein kinaray par let jate."
"271","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ibn Abi Umar, qala: haddasana Ma'n, 'an Malik, 'an Ibn Shihab, isi jaisi (h) wa haddasana Qutaiba, 'an Malik, 'an Ibn Shihab, isi jaisi."
"272","[AI-translation] Hamain haddath kiya Hannad ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya Abu Al-Ahwas ne, Al-A'mash se, Ibrahim se, Al-Aswad se, 'A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) raat mein nau rakat namaaz padha karte the. Hamain haddath kiya Mahmud bin Ghaylan ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya Yahya bin Adam ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya Sufyan Al-Thawri ne, Al-A'mash se, is ki misil."
"273","[AI-translation] Hamain haddath kiya Hannad ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya Abu Al-Ahwas ne, Al-A'mash se, Ibrahim se, Al-Aswad se, 'A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) raat mein nau rakat namaaz padha karte the. Hamain haddath kiya Mahmud bin Ghaylan ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya Yahya bin Adam ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya Sufyan Al-Thawri ne, Al-A'mash se, is ki misil."
"274","[AI-translation] Hamain haddath kiya Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya Muhammad bin Ja'far ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya Shu'ba ne, 'Amr bin Murra se, Abu Hamza se, Ansar ke ek shakhs se, Bani 'Abs ke ek shakhs se, Hudhayfa bin Al-Yaman se, ki unhone Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke sath raat mein namaaz padhi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab unhone namaaz mein dakhil hokar kaha: Allahu Akbar, Zul-Malakuti wal-Jabarut, wal-Kibriya'i wal-Azamah. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhone Al-Baqara padhi, phir unka ruku unke qiyam ke qareeb tha, aur kaha karte the: Subhana Rabbiya Al-Azim, Subhana Rabbiya Al-Azim. Phir unhone sar uthaya, toh unka qiyam unke ruku ke qareeb tha, aur kaha karte the: Li Rabbiya Al-Hamd, Li Rabbiya Al-Hamd. Phir unhone sajdah kiya, toh unka sajdah unke qiyam ke qareeb tha, aur kaha karte the: Subhana Rabbiya Al-A'la, Subhana Rabbiya Al-A'la. Phir unhone sar uthaya, toh dono sajdon ke darmiyan ka waqt sajdah ke qareeb tha, aur kaha karte the: Rabbi Ighfir Li, Rabbi Ighfir Li. Yahan tak ke unhone Al-Baqara, Aal-e-Imran, Al-Nisa', Al-Ma'ida ya Al-An'am padhi. Shu'ba jin mein shak tha Al-Ma'ida aur Al-An'am ke bare mein."
"275","[AI-translation] Hamain haddath kiya Abu Bakr Muhammad bin Nafi' Al-Basri ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya 'Abd Al-Samad bin 'Abd Al-Warith ne, Isma'il bin Muslim Al-'Abdi se, Abu Al-Mutawakkil se, 'A'isha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ek raat Quran ki ek aiyat par khare rahe."
"276","[AI-translation] Hamain haddath kiya Mahmud bin Ghaylan ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya Sulayman bin Harb ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya Shu'ba ne, Al-A'mash se, Abu Wa'il se, 'Abd Allah bin Mas'ud se, unhone kaha: Maine ek raat Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke sath namaaz padhi, pas woh khade rahe yahan tak ke maine ek bure kaam ka irada kiya. Unse pucha gaya: Aapne kya irada kiya? Unhone kaha: Maine irada kiya ke baith jaon aur Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko chhod doon. Hamain haddath kiya Sufyan bin Waki' ne, kaha: Hamain haddath kiya Jarir ne, Al-A'mash se, is ki misil."
